  "description": "Go Seunghwan, a former world champion in jiu-jitsu, wakes up to find the world has collapsed into chaos. Civilization is gone. The streets are overrun with zombies. And worst of all—he’s already infected. But that doesn’t matter. He has one goal left. To find and save his daughter, no matter the cost. Even if his body fails, his will won’t. A father’s final fight begins—against the undead, against time, and against himself.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
